WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.701
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.503
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.637
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:05.838
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.907
Today was so-called
Blackout Wednesday,

00:00:08.907 --> 00:00:11.878
which is known as the biggest
bar night of the year,

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.680
so, if you're watching me
right now,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.714
you a loser.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.751
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.621
Let me also stress that,
if you're watching me right now,

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.423
I am fast asleep.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.824
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.159
I filmed this show
earlier today.

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:28.094
You're awake.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.462
I'm out cold.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.529
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:31.464
I a loser.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.332
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:35.602
The White House has released
a so-called menu

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.703
of accomplishments
that supporters can use

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.506
to talk up President Biden
around the Thanksgiving table.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.576
And, that way, your parents
won't even have to ask

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:44.744
if you're still single.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.647
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.283
The Biden administration
yesterday launched a campaign

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.153
urging Americans to get updated
coronavirus vaccines.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.221
You launched it yesterday?!

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.756
[ Laughter ]
We're seeing Grandma tomorrow!

00:00:57.756 --> 00:00:59.258
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:02.028
Any other campaigns you want
to start too late?

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:04.564
Maybe urge us to vote
two weeks ago?

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.399
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.368
Dr. Anthony Fauci said yesterday
that his final message

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.771
from the White House podium is
for Americans

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.807
to get an updated
coronavirus booster

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.541
to protect themselves
and their family.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:18.110
He added, "And do it now
because, after Thanksgiving,

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.012
you may not want
to protect them anymore."

00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:24.717
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:25.418
Yeah, okay.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:26.386
[ Cheering ]

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.087
Yeah.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.489
You know what?

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:32.292
Yeah, I might want them to die.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.693
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:37.897
Georgia Senator
Raphael Warnock's
campaign yesterday

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.799
premiered a new video
that features

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.600
Republican challenger
Herschel Walker's

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:43.302
former teacher, which is brave,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.771
because I can't imagine having
to tell people

00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:48.640
that you taught Herschel Walker
everything he knows.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.576
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.312
Republican Senator Ted Cruz
posted a picture yesterday

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:56.049
with former Democratic
presidential hopeful
Andrew Yang.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:58.084
Though, if he's hanging out
with Ted Cruz,

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.986
I can guarantee he is no longer
Democratic or hopeful.

00:02:00.986 --> 00:02:03.222
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:04.456
According to a new study,

00:02:04.456 --> 00:02:07.193
long COVID can cause
significant brain changes,

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.328
but you think
the fake news media

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:12.097
would ever report on that,
you liberal cucks?!

00:02:12.097 --> 00:02:14.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.068
Sorry.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.037
That was weird.
I don't know.

00:02:19.037 --> 00:02:22.008
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.977 line:0%
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley
posted a photo yesterday

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:26.546 line:0%
of his vacuum cleaner and said,

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.813 line:0%
"Thanksgiving has arrived."

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:30.049 line:0%
So, I guess the only mystery is

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.685 line:0%
which of those things
he meant to do.

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:36.523 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:39.825
New York Governor Kathy Hochul
this week signed a bill into law

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:42.194
partially banning the mining
of cryptocurrency,

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:44.230
so, you know what that means.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.232
Hopefully, because I don't.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:49.135
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:55.274
According to a new survey,
35% of Americans believe

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:58.044
that the person with the window
seat on an airplane

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:59.545
should have exact--
excuse me --

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:02.581
exclusive power
over the window shade.

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:05.418
Okay, but whenever they open it,
the person on the aisle

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:08.086
should still get to yell,
"Still just clouds?!

00:03:08.086 --> 00:03:10.890
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.159
Do give an update
to the rest of us."

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:15.394
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:17.063
And, finally, a museum in Texas

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:18.731
recently broke
a Guinness World Record

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.633
by printing the world's
largest book,

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.434
that is 7 feet tall
and 11 feet wide.

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:25.638
It also set a record by being
the first book of 2022

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.240
that isn't about Trump.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.041
[ Laughter ]
And that, you guys,

00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:31.744
[ Cheering and applause ]
was a monologue.

